#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:5
#: 6e830780a9e6492e890b82b7def81490
msgid "Copter Motors Library"
msgstr "Copter 电机库"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:7
#: 8e04278c001442e9aa4bcbc42a7197b9
msgid ""
"This page covers the basics of the `Copter motors library "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Motors>`__"
msgstr ""
"本页介绍 `Copter 电机库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Motors>`__ "
"的基础知识"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:9
#: 2bed40b4facd41048275b407cd5b9a24
msgid ""
"As a reference the diagram below provides a high level view of Copter's "
"architecture.  The motors library can be seen near the bottom right just "
"above the \"Hardware Abstraction Layer\""
msgstr "下图提供了 Copter 架构的高层视图，可在右下角靠近「硬件抽象层」处看到电机库。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:15
#: c518ee5da71346d8aba00b8e5b41feee
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports over 22 different multicopter frames.  The Motors library"
" is designed to consolidate the majority of the differences in these frame "
"types from the higher level code including the attitude controllers and "
"vehicle specific code.  In other words the library provides a common "
"interface so that all vehicles can be controlled in the same way without "
"special handling being required in higher level code."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持超过 22 "
"种不同的多旋翼机架。电机库旨在将这些机架类型与上层代码（包括姿态控制器和特定飞行器代码）之间的主要差异集中处理。换句话说，该库提供了统一接口，使所有飞行器都能以相同方式控制，而无需在上层代码中进行特殊处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:17
#: eddb04eb5a9a46f9a6f0749f5c6d57f6
msgid ""
"The image below shows a categorisation of these frames which is consistent "
"with the class structure"
msgstr "下图展示了这些机架的分类，与类结构保持一致"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:23
#: 3b1dc852b219468d9dfeb249731a225a
msgid ""
"Multicopter Matrix : vehicles with mostly downward facing propellers and no "
"servos.  These are the most commonly used frames and the code can be found "
"in the `AP_MotorsMatrix "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.h>`__"
" class"
msgstr ""
"多旋翼矩阵：螺旋桨主要朝下且无舵机的飞行器。这是最常用的机架类型，代码可在 `AP_MotorsMatrix "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.h>`__"
" 类中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:24
#: 4404578bb26b4df5ad8106b9a82fd2bb
msgid ""
"Multicopter Tri and Single: vehicles with a combination of motors and "
"servos.  These are peers of each other and Multicopter Matrix and can be "
"found in the `AP_MotorsTri "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsTri.h>`__"
" and `AP_MotorsSingle "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsSingle.h>`__"
" classes"
msgstr ""
"多旋翼三旋翼与单旋翼：由电机和舵机组合构成的飞行器。它们相互平行，也与多旋翼矩阵并列，分别可在 `AP_MotorsTri "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsTri.h>`__"
" 和 `AP_MotorsSingle "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsSingle.h>`__"
" 类中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:25
#: 2b548b203fe84a34825fbc8d8f66b601
msgid ""
"Helicopter Single, Quad: vehicles with swashplates that can provide reverse "
"thrust.  These are peers of each other and children of the `AP_MotorsHeli "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsHeli.h>`__"
" class."
msgstr ""
"直升机单旋翼、四旋翼：带斜盘且能提供反推力的飞行器。它们相互并列，均为 `AP_MotorsHeli "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsHeli.h>`__"
" 类的子类。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:27
#: 300fcf2bb85f45f3855c841175edb1ab
msgid "Below is a diagram of the Motors library's class hierarchy"
msgstr "下图为电机库的类层次结构图"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:34
#: c9d5a13a4b854e0dbedcf3f9634a4f7d
msgid "Inputs to the Motors Library"
msgstr "电机库的输入"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:36
#: 638b1e455bc14a21b4797403153283c8
msgid ""
"The Attitude Controller provides high level roll, pitch, yaw and throttle "
"commands to the Motors library in the range of -1 to +1 (for roll, pitch and"
" yaw) or 0 to +1 (for throttle).  The exact point where the attitude "
"controller issues these commands can be found in AC_AttitudeControl_Multi's "
"`rate_controller_run() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AC_AttitudeControl/AC_AttitudeControl_Multi.cpp#L253>`__"
" method"
msgstr ""
"姿态控制器向电机库提供高层的横滚、俯仰、偏航和油门指令，范围为 -1 到 +1（横滚、俯仰和偏航）或 0 到 "
"+1（油门）。姿态控制器发出这些指令的具体位置可在 AC_AttitudeControl_Multi 的 `rate_controller_run() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AC_AttitudeControl/AC_AttitudeControl_Multi.cpp#L253>`__"
" 方法中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:48
#: ccdc828b52d542a5b3dfa30795bdbb94
msgid ""
"and the definitions of the methods used can be seen in `AP_Motors_Class.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L78>`__"
msgstr ""
"所用方法的定义可在 `AP_Motors_Class.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L78>`__"
" 中查看"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:59
#: 1da1dec0ec26453186c1c2eba0bb52e8
msgid "Outputs and Responsibilities"
msgstr "输出与职责"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:61
#: 47e2a7ab113b4f51b41c93422fc2f441
msgid "All motors libraries must do two things:"
msgstr "所有电机库必须完成两件事："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:63
#: 67551064bfd44e1e9e523a84b4f9a7d2
msgid ""
"Convert the high level inputs from the attitude controller to individual "
"motor and servo outputs"
msgstr "将姿态控制器的高层输入转换为各电机和舵机的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:65
#: 22f8b3116d8d43058cf85418407f208b
msgid ""
"Roll input of +1.0 should cause motor and servo outputs that provide maximum"
" roll rotation to the right"
msgstr "横滚输入 +1.0 应使电机和舵机输出产生最大向右横滚的旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:66
#: 58462aedfe1749e48a2297f0718998de
msgid "Pitch input of +1.0 should result in maximum pitch back"
msgstr "俯仰输入 +1.0 应产生最大向后俯仰"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:67
#: 1baa60c7a89d49bcaea748707819d0bd
msgid ""
"Yaw input of +1.0 should result in maximum yaw in the clockwise direction"
msgstr "偏航输入 +1.0 应产生顺时针方向的最大偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:68
#: 29e1848f5c064171b2ee7101a073c168
msgid ""
"Throttle input of +1.0 should result in maximum acceleration upwards (in the"
" vehicle's body frame).  Throttle of zero should result in minimum "
"acceleration upwards (or maximum acceleration downwards in the case of "
"helicopters)"
msgstr "油门输入 +1.0 应产生最大向上加速度（在飞行器机体坐标系中）。油门为零应产生最小向上加速度（或直升机情况下的最大向下加速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:70
#: dd2797f2de204644bb44d1d229da9e48
msgid ""
"Set the limit flags to avoid \"I-term build-up\" in the attitude and "
"throttle controllers.  Although a vehicle will be flyable without setting "
"these flags, they are important for protecting against overshoot in lean "
"angle control and also for automatic landing detection.  The limits are held"
" in the `AP_Motors_Class::limit "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L118>`__"
" variable."
msgstr ""
"设置限制标志以避免姿态和油门控制器中出现「积分项累积」。虽然不设置这些标志飞行器仍可飞行，但它们对于防止倾斜角控制过冲以及自动着陆检测非常重要。这些限制保存在"
" `AP_Motors_Class::limit "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L118>`__"
" 变量中。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:83
#: 3f172d367cfd4ffb81fa90c95a14beb5
msgid "Adding support for a new \"Multicopter Matrix\" frame"
msgstr "添加对新「多旋翼矩阵」机架的支持"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:85
#: 967556f48f5a4d43849d3e0c36e51096
msgid ""
"To add support for a new Multicopter Matrix frame type (i.e. a frame with "
"downward facing propellers and no servos):"
msgstr "要添加对新多旋翼矩阵机架类型（即螺旋桨朝下且无舵机的机架）的支持："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:87
#: 599096db463e4976aec8a3e781954130
msgid ""
"Decide on a name for the frame and add a new entry into either the "
"motor_frame_class and/or motor_frame_type enums found in "
"`AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L32>`__"
msgstr ""
"确定机架名称，并在 `AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_Motors_Class.h#L32>`__"
" 中的 motor_frame_class 和/或 motor_frame_type 枚举中添加新条目"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:88
#: 725d0c363ee54f889d7e7707a72dfe17
msgid ""
"Add the same number(s) from the above step to the `FRAME_CLASS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L848>`__"
" and/or `FRAME_TYPE "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L361>`__"
" parameters descriptions"
msgstr ""
"将上一步中的相同编号添加到 `FRAME_CLASS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L848>`__"
" 和/或 `FRAME_TYPE "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L361>`__"
" 参数描述中"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:89
#: eafd917bc0a84523b4eeb31f3b734eb8
msgid ""
"Add a new case to the `AP_MotorsMatrix::setup_motors() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L466>`__"
" for the new frame class and/or frame type"
msgstr ""
"在 `AP_MotorsMatrix::setup_motors() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L466>`__"
" 中为新机架类别和/或机架类型添加新的 case 分支"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:91
#: 155609e9052e46ea9dfb473eb5312532
msgid ""
"Use AP_MotorsMatrix::add_motor() or `AP_MotorsMatrix::add_motor_raw() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.h#L62>`__"
" functions to set the roll, pitch and yaw factors for each motor on the "
"vehicle.  These factors are multiplied by the high level roll, pitch and yaw"
" input from the attitude controllers and the result is then output to the "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"使用 AP_MotorsMatrix::add_motor() 或 `AP_MotorsMatrix::add_motor_raw() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.h#L62>`__"
" 函数为飞行器上每个电机设置横滚、俯仰和偏航系数。这些系数与姿态控制器的高层横滚、俯仰和偏航输入相乘，结果输出到各电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:92
#: f269e69a57f5410da7d0ce69500b8043
msgid ""
"The above add_motor function's testing_order argument specifies the order in"
" which the motors should spin when the user initiates a motor test.  "
"Normally each motor's testing order should be relative to its position on "
"the frame in a clockwise direction."
msgstr ""
"上述 add_motor 函数的 testing_order "
"参数指定用户发起电机测试时各电机的转动顺序。通常每个电机的测试顺序应按其在机架上的位置顺时针排列。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:93
#: 1495afbe7e38478e943d0f7f1a021621
msgid ""
"set success = true at the bottom of the case to alert the AP_Motors "
"initialisation code that the frame has been setup"
msgstr "在 case 底部将 success 设为 true，以通知 AP_Motors 初始化代码机架已完成配置"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-copter-motors-library.rst:95
#: 58a8e4550e494665829ccf2d601f83b4
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions are not yet available for adding more complex frame "
"types (sorry!)"
msgstr "目前尚无添加更复杂机架类型的详细说明（抱歉！）"
